  "contentHtmlFurigana": "\n                      <div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">なんとなんと…ついに…</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">ひらがな</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">2</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><ruby>期<rt>き</rt></ruby><ruby>生<rt>せい</rt></ruby>のブログが<ruby>始<rt>はじ</rt></ruby>まりました</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">!!</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">トップバッター<ruby>金村<rt>かなむら</rt></ruby><ruby>美玖<rt>みく</rt></ruby>です。</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2017-12-01/23989_0.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_0198.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">ブログは<ruby>自己<rt>じこ</rt></ruby><ruby>表現<rt>ひょうげん</rt></ruby>ができる<ruby>場<rt>ば</rt></ruby>のひとつなので</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">こうやって<ruby>書<rt>か</rt></ruby>かせて<ruby>頂<rt>いただ</rt></ruby>くことができてとっても<ruby>嬉<rt>うれ</rt></ruby>しいです！ありがとうございます。&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">これから<ruby>日替<rt>ひが</rt></ruby>わりで2<ruby>期生<rt>きせい</rt></ruby>がブログを<ruby>更新<rt>こうしん</rt></ruby>させて<ruby>頂<rt>いただ</rt></ruby>きます。</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">これをきっかけに2<ruby>期生<rt>きせい</rt></ruby>のことをもっと<ruby>色々<rt>いろいろ</rt></ruby><ruby>知<rt>し</rt></ruby>っていただけたら<ruby>嬉<rt>うれ</rt></ruby>しいです</span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">(</span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">´</span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">﹀</span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">`</span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">)</span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">はじめてのブログなので</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>少<rt>すこ</rt></ruby>し<ruby>自己<rt>じこ</rt></ruby><ruby>紹介<rt>しょうかい</rt></ruby>をさせてください！</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">☆&nbsp;<ruby>金村<rt>かなむら</rt></ruby><ruby>美玖<rt>みく</rt></ruby></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">☆&nbsp;2002<ruby>年<rt>ねん</rt></ruby>9<ruby>月<rt>つき</rt></ruby>10<ruby>日<rt>にち</rt></ruby><ruby>生<rt>う</rt></ruby>まれ（15<ruby>歳<rt>さい</rt></ruby>）</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">☆&nbsp;O<ruby>型<rt>がた</rt></ruby></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">☆&nbsp;<ruby>特技<rt>とくぎ</rt></ruby>→アルトサックス</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">☆&nbsp;<ruby>好<rt>す</rt></ruby>きな<ruby>食べ物<rt>たべもの</rt></ruby>→お<ruby>寿司<rt>すし</rt></ruby>!!（<ruby>生魚<rt>なまざかな</rt></ruby>）</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">☆&nbsp;<ruby>嫌<rt>きら</rt></ruby>いな<ruby>食べ物<rt>たべもの</rt></ruby>→トマト、きゅうり</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>無類<rt>むるい</rt></ruby>の<ruby>生魚<rt>なまざかな</rt></ruby><ruby>好<rt>す</rt></ruby>きなんです。お<ruby>寿司<rt>すし</rt></ruby>を<ruby>食<rt>た</rt></ruby>べると<ruby>大体<rt>だいたい</rt></ruby>は<ruby>元気<rt>げんき</rt></ruby>になります。</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>中<rt>なか</rt></ruby>でも<ruby>私<rt>わたし</rt></ruby>のお<ruby>気に入<rt>きにい</rt></ruby>りは<ruby>中<rt>ちゅう</rt></ruby>トロ、うに、はまちなどですかねぇ…ぶりも<ruby>好<rt>す</rt></ruby>きだなぁ…<ruby>結局<rt>けっきょく</rt></ruby><ruby>全部<rt>ぜんぶ</rt></ruby><ruby>美味<rt>おい</rt></ruby>しいです<ruby>笑<rt>えみ</rt></ruby></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">これからもっと<ruby>私<rt>わたし</rt></ruby>のことをお<ruby>伝<rt>つた</rt></ruby>えしていきますね！</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">さっそく<ruby>話題<rt>わだい</rt></ruby>が<ruby>変<rt>か</rt></ruby>わるのですが、</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><ruby>私<rt>わたし</rt></ruby><ruby>達<rt>たち</rt></ruby></span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">2</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><ruby>期<rt>き</rt></ruby><ruby>生<rt>せい</rt></ruby>とっても<ruby>仲<rt>なか</rt></ruby>が<ruby>良<rt>よ</rt></ruby>いんです！</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">オーディション<ruby>合格<rt>ごうかく</rt></ruby>した<ruby>頃<rt>ころ</rt></ruby>からほぼみんな<ruby>打ち解<rt>うちと</rt></ruby>けていて、<ruby>年<rt>とし</rt></ruby>の<ruby>差<rt>さ</rt></ruby><ruby>関係<rt>かんけい</rt></ruby>なくいつもワイワイしています。みんなそれぞれの<ruby>個性<rt>こせい</rt></ruby>があって<ruby>一緒<rt>いっしょ</rt></ruby>にいてとても<ruby>楽<rt>たの</rt></ruby>しいし、<ruby>大好<rt>だいす</rt></ruby>きです！</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2017-12-01/23989_1.jpg\" alt=\"1C5AD9CA-ADB8-4F7E-A54D-8035DA45E818.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">これは<ruby>初<rt>はつ</rt></ruby>レッスンの<ruby>時<rt>とき</rt></ruby>の<ruby>写真<rt>しゃしん</rt></ruby>です！</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">みんな<ruby>初々<rt>ういうい</rt></ruby>しいですね(´▽`)</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">この<ruby>時<rt>とき</rt></ruby>は<ruby>名前<rt>なまえ</rt></ruby><ruby>入<rt>い</rt></ruby>りのビブスを<ruby>初<rt>はじ</rt></ruby>めて<ruby>着<rt>き</rt></ruby>れて</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">みんな<ruby>喜<rt>よろこ</rt></ruby>んでいました<ruby>笑<rt>えみ</rt></ruby></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">もう<ruby>合格<rt>ごうかく</rt></ruby>してから<ruby>約<rt>やく</rt></ruby>4<ruby>ヶ月<rt>かげつ</rt></ruby><ruby>経<rt>た</rt></ruby>つんです…</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>初<rt>はつ</rt></ruby>の「<ruby>欅<rt>けやき</rt></ruby>って<ruby>書<rt>か</rt></ruby>けない？」<ruby>出演<rt>しゅつえん</rt></ruby>や<ruby>雑誌<rt>ざっし</rt></ruby><ruby>撮影<rt>さつえい</rt></ruby>などたくさん<ruby>初<rt>はじ</rt></ruby>めてのことをさせて<ruby>頂<rt>いただ</rt></ruby>いた<ruby>濃<rt>こ</rt></ruby>い</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">4<ruby>ヶ月<rt>かげつ</rt></ruby>だったなと<ruby>思<rt>おも</rt></ruby>います。<ruby>本当<rt>ほんとう</rt></ruby>にありがたい<ruby>気持<rt>きも</rt></ruby>ちでいっぱいです。</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">まだまだ<ruby>未熟<rt>みじゅく</rt></ruby>ですが、<ruby>先輩<rt>せんぱい</rt></ruby><ruby>方<rt>かた</rt></ruby>のように</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">なんでもこなせるアイドルになれるよう<ruby>日々<rt>ひび</rt></ruby><ruby>精進<rt>しょうじん</rt></ruby>していきたいと<ruby>思<rt>おも</rt></ruby>います！</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2017-12-01/23989_2.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_0763.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">B.L.T.さんの<ruby>衣装<rt>いしょう</rt></ruby>です!!かっこかわいい～</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">もっともっと<ruby>載<rt>の</rt></ruby>せたいみんなとの<ruby>写真<rt>しゃしん</rt></ruby>が</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">あるのですが…<ruby>順々<rt>じゅんじゅん</rt></ruby>に<ruby>投稿<rt>とうこう</rt></ruby>していきますね♪</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>明日<rt>あした</rt></ruby>は…<ruby>大<rt>だい</rt></ruby><ruby>大<rt>だい</rt></ruby><ruby>大好<rt>だいす</rt></ruby>きなこの<ruby>子<rt>こ</rt></ruby>です!!</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">お<ruby>楽<rt>たの</rt></ruby>しみに～</span></p>\n<br>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><img id=\"C03202D4-3B69-47EB-8462-C2CCB1FCE39C\" src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2017-12-01/23989_3.jpg\" alt=\"image2.jpeg\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">see you later ✩*.ﾟ</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>金村<rt>かなむら</rt></ruby> <ruby>美玖<rt>みく</rt></ruby>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<div><strong>&nbsp;</strong></div>\n</div>\n                    ",
